    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Enjoy a luxurious stay for the Ryder Cup 2027 in this beautifully presented four-bedroom home, nestled in the peaceful countryside of North Cork.\r\n\r\nThis spacious property offers modern, comfortable accommodation, making it an excellent choice for families, corporate guests or golfing groups travelling to the Ryder Cup at Adare Manor.\r\n\r\nDesigned with both comfort and convenience in mind, the home provides generous living spaces and well-appointed bedrooms, ensuring a relaxing stay throughout the tournament.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\nSpacious detached residence\r\n4 generously sized bedrooms\r\n3 bathrooms\r\n2 bedrooms with private en-suite bathrooms\r\n2 additional bedrooms sharing a modern family bathroom adjacent to both rooms\r\nComfortable living room\r\nFully equipped kitchen and dining area\r\nBright and spacious interior with plenty of natural light\r\nHigh-speed Wi-Fi\r\nPrivate parking\r\nPeaceful countryside setting\r\nExcellent Ryder Cup Location\r\nApproximately 1 hour's drive to Adare Manor, host venue for the Ryder Cup 2027.\r\nApproximately 45 minutes' drive to the official East Park & Ride at Croom, where shuttle services will operate to Adare Manor during the event.\r\nNearby Attractions\r\nSituated in the picturesque village of Liscarroll, Co. Cork.\r\nJust minutes from the historic Liscarroll Castle, one of Ireland's finest surviving Norman castles.\r\nClose to the bustling market town of Charleville, offering cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and local amenities.\r\nWithin easy reach of Doneraile Park, the Ballyhoura Mountains, and the renowned Ballyhoura Forest Trails, ideal for walking and mountain biking.\r\nConvenient access to both Cork and Limerick, making it an ideal base for exploring the south-west of Ireland.\r\nNearby Golf Courses\r\nGolf enthusiasts will be spoiled for choice, with several excellent courses located within easy driving distance, including:\r\n\r\nCharleville Golf Club – A picturesque 18-hole parkland course approximately 20 minutes away.\r\nBallyhoura Golf Club, Kilfinane – A scenic course set amongst the Ballyhoura countryside, approximately 30 minutes away.\r\nMallow Golf Club – A superb mature parkland course approximately 30 minutes away.\r\nCahir Park Golf Club – An excellent championship-standard course within comfortable driving distance.\r\nAdare Manor Golf Course – Host venue of the 2027 Ryder Cup, approximately 1 hour away.\r\nWhether you're travelling to experience the excitement of the Ryder Cup or planning to explore the beautiful countryside of Cork and Limerick, this exceptional home offers the perfect combination of luxury, comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nAvailable exclusively for the Ryder Cup 2027 period. Early enquiries are strongly recommended."
      }
    ],
